    "title": "Don Quixote",
    "desc": "Don Quixote by Miguel de Cervantes is famous because it is widely considered the first modern novel and a masterclass in exploring the conflict b/w human idealism and harsh reality.The Art of Becoming: Unlike epic heroes (Achilles or Odysseus) who stay the same from start to end, Don Quixote and his squire Sancho Panza , learn, and grow & change as people through their experiences.The book dives deep into how individuals perceive the world versus how the world actually is, in later prose fiction.",
